{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "校管家 TMS Web 1:1 复刻",
  "source": "https://tms03.xiaogj.com；使用用户授权账号登录观察，凭证仅用于会话，不写入文件或 Git。原版业务数据不假定可重置。",
  "target": "Web；采用 firstedu-engineering/realus-ops 的技术栈，以用户提供的技术列表为约束，并核对参考仓库依赖。",
  "objective": "1:1 复刻 tms03.xiaogj.com 在授权账号可访问范围内的页面、内容结构、视觉、交互与业务行为，交付可运行的前后端与持久化实现。",
  "completion": [
    "原版已观察需求形成有来源的共同业务与前端模具，继续探索未知页面、控件、输入方式与状态分支；不能用当前视口或菜单代替需求全集。",
    "按相同状态、内容、视口和滚动复验原版与候选，覆盖登录、主页、导航及所有已发现业务旅程、视觉、反馈、动效、持久化与实际存在的声音。",
    "使用指定技术栈交付可启动、可构建、可复跑的实现；保留失败及未验证结果，不以测试全通过替代 1:1 验收。",
    "凭证、会话、私有业务数据和原版媒体只保存在忽略的本地私有路径；提交仅包含任务授权的原创代码及可公开的契约。"
  ],
  "inputs": {
    "technical_reference": "projects/xiaogj-web/TECHNOLOGY.md",
    "reference_observations": "projects/xiaogj-web/reference-contract.json",
    "frontend_contract": "projects/xiaogj-web/frontend-contract.json",
    "frontend_scenarios": "projects/xiaogj-web/home-scenarios.json",
    "exploration_history": "projects/xiaogj-web/exploration-history.json",
    "historical_frontend_result": "projects/xiaogj-web/private/candidate/2026-10-12-home/frontend-v1.json"
  },
  "commands": {
    "build": [
      "npx",
      "--yes",
      "--package=node@24.18.0",
      "--package=pnpm@11.15.1",
      "--",
      "pnpm",
      "--dir",
      "projects/xiaogj-web",
      "build"
    ],
    "typecheck": [
      "npx",
      "--yes",
      "--package=node@24.18.0",
      "--package=pnpm@11.15.1",
      "--",
      "pnpm",
      "--dir",
      "projects/xiaogj-web",
      "typecheck"
    ],
    "test": [
      "npx",
      "--yes",
      "--package=node@24.18.0",
      "--",
      "node",
      "--test",
      "projects/xiaogj-web/apps/web/src/home-state.test.mjs"
    ],
    "compare_frontend": [
      "python3",
      "-m",
      "capabilities.rebuild.frontend",
      "--workspace",
      ".",
      "--contract",
      "projects/xiaogj-web/frontend-contract.json",
      "--observed",
      "{observed}",
      "--out",
      "{out}"
    ],
    "frontier": [
      "python3",
      "-m",
      "capabilities.rebuild.discovery",
      "--workspace",
      ".",
      "--history",
      "projects/xiaogj-web/exploration-history.json",
      "--out",
      "{out}"
    ]
  }
}
